# Git author for Vercel

This private repo deploys to a **Hobby** Vercel team. Hobby does not allow
collaboration, so a commit authored as SuperPatchAi (or any other GitHub user)
is blocked.

On **every** `git commit` in this repo, set author and committer for that
command only. Do not run `git config`. Do not rewrite published history unless
the user explicitly asks to force-push.

```bash
GIT_AUTHOR_NAME="makemoney2023" \
GIT_AUTHOR_EMAIL="124006256+makemoney2023@users.noreply.github.com" \
GIT_COMMITTER_NAME="makemoney2023" \
GIT_COMMITTER_EMAIL="124006256+makemoney2023@users.noreply.github.com" \
git commit -m "$(cat <<'EOF'
Commit message here.

EOF
)"
```

After the commit, confirm `git log -1 --format='%an <%ae>'` prints
`makemoney2023 <124006256+makemoney2023@users.noreply.github.com>` before pushing.
